ource":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:212d9c9e5cb656a0f5cb35fb966b4e8928576c4351f98e6cdf852be32b216490","file":"preprints/A-Coulomb-Ground-State-Density-without-Kohn-Sham-Ensemble-Representation-September-25-2026/build/main.tex","line":131,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"2918cd1d2592405cd7268ff50d0ea1bbbbd256c81c2689bf07045c03b1de58a6","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/A-Coulomb-Ground-State-Density-without-Kohn-Sham-Ensemble-Representation-September-25-2026/build/main.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:212d9c9e5cb656a0f5cb35fb966b4e8928576c4351f98e6cdf852be32b216490","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/A-Coulomb-Ground-State-Density-without-Kohn-Sham-Ensemble-Representation-September-25-2026/build/main.tex#L131"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nSet \\(D=10^{200}\\) and \\(e_z=(0,0,1)\\).\nThere is a finite positive integer \\(Z\\), specified by\n\\Cref{eq:explicit-charge}, for which the Coulomb Hamiltonian\n\\[\nH_C=\\sum_{i=1}^3\n\\left(-\\frac12\\Delta_i\n-\\frac{Z}{|r_i-(D/Z)e_z|}\n-\\frac{Z}{|r_i+(D/Z)e_z|}\\right)\n+\\sum_{1\\le i<j\\le3}\\frac1{|r_i-r_j|}\n\\]\nhas a normalizable absolute ground state \\(\\Psi\\) in the sector\n\\(S_z=1/2\\), normalized by \\(\\|\\Psi\\|_2=1\\), but there is no\n\\(v\\in\\mathcal V\\) and no ground-state\nensemble \\(\\Gamma\\) of \\(H_s(v)\\) such that\n\\[\nn_\\Gamma=n_\\Psi\\qquad\\text{almost everywhere on }\\R^3.\n\\]"}
